{"title":"Combined feed","url":"https://Vinnl.github.io/feeds/all.xml","elements":[{"title":"Neso (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that the orbit of Neptune's moon <b><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Neso_(moon)\" title=\"Neso (moon)\">Neso</a></b> <i>(pictured)</i> is strongly influenced by the Sun's gravity?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Neso_(moon)","retrieved":1784919514880},{"title":"a U.S. president's father (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that <b><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/James_Buchanan_Sr.\" title=\"James Buchanan Sr.\">a U.S. president's father</a></b> did not like that his son became a politician—but changed his mind?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/James_Buchanan_Sr.","retrieved":1784919514882},{"title":"At the Optometrist (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that the baseball cap seen in <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Norman_Rockwell\" title=\"Norman Rockwell\">Norman Rockwell</a>'s <i><b><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/At_the_Optometrist\" title=\"At the Optometrist\">At the Optometrist</a></b></i> was likely influenced by the <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Brooklyn_Dodgers\" title=\"Brooklyn Dodgers\">Brooklyn Dodgers</a> winning the <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/1955_World_Series\" title=\"1955 World Series\">1955 World Series</a>?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/At_the_Optometrist","retrieved":1784919514884},{"title":"underground forums (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that the cybercrime community may have begun migrating from web-based <b><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Underground_forum\" title=\"Underground forum\">underground forums</a></b> to private channels such as Telegram?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Underground_forum","retrieved":1784919514886},{"title":"Hitler's Favourite Royal (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that the documentary <i><b><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hitler's_Favourite_Royal\" title=\"Hitler's Favourite Royal\">Hitler's Favourite Royal</a></b></i> was considered by some reviewers to be overly sympathetic to its subject?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hitler's_Favourite_Royal","retrieved":1784919514887},{"title":"Faileuba (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that <b><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Faileuba\" title=\"Faileuba\">Faileuba</a></b> may have been chosen to marry King <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Childebert_II\" title=\"Childebert II\">Childebert II</a> because of her low birth and lack of political connections?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Faileuba","retrieved":1784919514889},{"title":"7 July Memorial (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that the <b><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/7_July_Memorial_(Tavistock_Square)\" title=\"7 July Memorial (Tavistock Square)\">7<span typeof=\"mw:Entity\">&nbsp;</span>July Memorial</a></b> in Tavistock Square, London, faces the site of the <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/7_July_2005_London_bombings\" title=\"7 July 2005 London bombings\">2005 bus bombing</a>?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/7_July_Memorial_(Tavistock_Square)","retrieved":1784919514890},{"title":"Ashworth family (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that by 1850 one member of the free Black <b><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ashworth_family\" title=\"Ashworth family\">Ashworth family</a></b> was the wealthiest person in <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jefferson_County,_Texas\" title=\"Jefferson County, Texas\">Jefferson County</a>?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ashworth_family","retrieved":1784919514892},{"title":"a Malawian newspaper (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that <b><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Weekend_Times\" title=\"Weekend Times\">a Malawian newspaper</a></b> ran an invitation for \"sexy, attractive and bootylicious young women\" to appear in future issues?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Weekend_Times","retrieved":1784919514893},{"title":"Destination of the Month (Wikivoyage recommendations)","contents":"<span class=\"mw-empty-elt\" about=\"#mwt8\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\" id=\"mwIQ\" data-mw=\"{&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;banner&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:&quot;./Template:Banner&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;direction&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;right&quot;},&quot;title&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;Cologne&quot;},&quot;type&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;dotm&quot;},&quot;image&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;CologneBanner1.jpg&quot;},&quot;quote&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;Founded by the Romans, Germany's fourth largest city is known for its enormous cathedral and the Karneval in February.&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}\"><style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r4523569\" typeof=\"mw:Extension/templatestyles\" about=\"#mwt9\" data-mw=\"{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;templatestyles&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;Banner/styles.css&quot;}}\">.mw-parser-output .mainpage-shadowbox{color:white;background:rgb(16,16,16);background:rgba(0,0,0,0.3);border-radius:4px}.mw-parser-output .mainpage-shadowbox h2,.mw-parser-output .mainpage-shadowbox h3{color:white;border:none;font-family:sans-serif;line-height:1.2em;margin:0;padding:0}.mw-parser-output .mainpage-shadowbox a{color:white;font-weight:bold}.mw-parser-output .banner-image{position:relative;max-width:1125px;height:auto;margin-bottom:.6em}.mw-parser-output .banner-image img{max-width:100%;height:auto}.mw-parser-output .banner-box-wide{width:80%}.mw-parser-output .banner-box-left,.mw-parser-output .banner-box-right{padding:8px 7